msgid "Calibration and Physical Units"
msgstr "校正と物理単位"

msgid "Techniques for applying frequency-dependent calibration transfer functions, verifying physical dimensional units, and guarding against inversion and grid errors."
msgstr "周波数依存の校正伝達関数の適用、物理次元・単位の整合性検証、および逆演算や周波数グリッド不一致の誤用を防ぐための技術解説です。"

msgid "Analysis Pathways"
msgstr "解析パス"

msgid "Calibration Units Contract"
msgstr "単位を保った校正適用"

msgid "Apply frequency-dependent response $C(f)$ to complex spectra and ASDs while enforcing astropy physical unit integrity."
msgstr "Astropy の物理単位完全性を維持しながら、周波数応答 $C(f)$ を複素スペクトルや ASD へ正しく適用します。"

msgid "Calibration Pipeline"
msgstr "校正パイプライン"

msgid "End-to-end calibration measurement, swept/stepped sine analysis, and model fitting."
msgstr "加振応答測定、スウェプト/ステップ正弦波解析、モデルフィッティングの一連の流れです。"

msgid "DTT XML Calibration"
msgstr "DTT XML 校正応答"

msgid "Load pre-measured calibration transfer functions directly from diagnostic test tool (DTT) XML files."
msgstr "診断測定ツール (DTT) XML ファイルから保存済み伝達関数を直接読み込みます。"

msgid "Physics Validation"
msgstr "物理的妥当性検証"

msgid "Automated unit sanity checks and consistency guards for gravitational-wave data containers."
msgstr "重力波データコンテナの自動単位検証と整合性ガード。"

msgid "Core Conventions"
msgstr "主要な規約"
